# SpecPlane

Default schema is v9.1.0. Follow `AGENTS.md`.

This repo has **two trees**: `specplane/` is the kit (language). `specs/` is the kernel product (what the CLI must do). Do not copy `specs/` into other apps. `design-docs/` is gitignored strategy, not specs.

For spec authoring, read `specplane/core_prompt/applicable/README.md` and load only the section for the current task. Do not attach `specplane_schema_prompt_v9.1.0.md` unless the user is changing the schema or explicitly asks for the complete reference.

Specs describe what and how well, not how. Keep bidirectional links in sync. Add a changelog entry when bumping `meta.version`.
